WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.280
The admin page: everything the coordinators need, in one place.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:10.675
Admins sign in with Google on the admin page. Your role shows in the title.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:19.080
You start in Spotter mode, so you can look around without changing anything by accident. Tap it to turn it off when you need to edit.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:27.355
The tabs across the top: the day grid, setup, units, families, who's short, the hat, background checks, review, and access.

00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:31.374
Links to the live board, the unit tracker, the point-person view,

00:00:31.574 --> 00:00:34.100
and back to your own family page.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.600
Next: the day grid.
